From: PA-220 port
Subject: MIPS: Octeon: populate simple-mfd child devices

Add "simple-mfd" to the bus match table so that devices below a
syscon/simple-mfd node (e.g. register-bit-led LEDs on the PA-220 CPLD)
are created.
---
--- a/arch/mips/cavium-octeon/octeon-platform.c
+++ b/arch/mips/cavium-octeon/octeon-platform.c
@@ -454,6 +454,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id octeon_
 	{ .compatible = "cavium,octeon-3860-bootbus", },
 	{ .compatible = "cavium,mdio-mux", },
 	{ .compatible = "gpio-leds", },
+	{ .compatible = "simple-mfd", },
 	{},
 };
 
